
.modal-header
  h5.modal-title(class='logoColor') Auto Transfer
.modal-body
  ul
    li This will enable automatic transfer of funds to linked payees as and when funds are received in this account
    li Funds will be split as per the % payout of each payee
    li Manual Transfer will be allowed for Retention amount only

.modal-footer
  button.btn.btn-link(type='button', (click)='onClose(false)', class='castlerButtonColor1') Cancel
  button.btn(type='button', (click)='onClose(true)', class='castlerButtonColor') Understood
